**Unit:** High — Agent 3 explicitly confirms per piece vs per sq ft ambiguity in this market. Custom-dimension buyers need per sq ft; standard-size buyers expect per piece. Canonical unit: per piece (dominant), with per sq ft for custom builds.

**Company:** Medium — fabricator's location (can they deliver/install at my site?), installation track record, and service capability matter. No dominant brands; Tata Steel Nest-In is notable but most market is unbranded regional fabricators → `brand_important: no`.

