### Phase 4 — Image Upload Assessment

**Image upload recommended: true.**

Container fabrication is a custom fabrication service with high design variation. Buyers — especially those converting existing shipping containers or requesting non-standard layouts — often have a reference design, floor plan sketch, or existing container they want replicated. For custom-dimensioned builds with specific interior fitout requirements (partition layouts, electrical points, window positions), a reference image or sketch allows sellers to assess feasibility and provide an accurate quote without a lengthy back-and-forth. This is analogous to the custom fabrication / design-match scenario.

